/-!
# Grand Capstone: Lie Geometry to BKM / Tomita--Takesaki Thermodynamic Modular Bridge

This capstone module connects the 12-ray Double Star of David root system of $\mathfrak{g}_{2(2)}$
and its dihedral Weyl symmetries $W(G_2) \cong D_{12}$ to:

1. **Finite Gibbs Ensembles on the Cartan Subalgebra**: The parameterized state space $\beta \in \mathbb{R}^2$.
